  "description": "UDUKUC crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4 2 m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H72 Cl1 N4 O8 Sm4 1-,C16 H40 Na1 O8 1+. From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.513-3.513 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.90-96.90°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H112ClN4NaO16Sm4.",
